---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Email from '../components/Email.astro';
---

<Base title="About | Matka Ceramics">
  <section class="mk-page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>Matka ceramics is a love letter to India's rich history in ceramics.</p>

    <p>
      Built from the ground up in Brooklyn, NY, Matka ceramics is created in small
      batches every few months, always inspired by practicality and heritage art.
      All pieces are handmade, unique, dishwasher-safe, and microwave-safe.
    </p>

    <h2>Care</h2>
    <p>
      Dishwasher and microwave safe. Unglazed terracotta will darken with use, which
      is the clay doing what clay does rather than a fault. Avoid sudden temperature
      changes, so don't take a piece from the fridge to a hot oven.
    </p>

    <h2>Shipping and returns</h2>
    <p>
      Orders ship from Brooklyn within 3 to 5 business days, to the US and Canada.
      You'll get a tracking number by email when the label is printed.
    </p>
    <p>
      If something arrives broken, email me with a photo and I'll refund it. Because
      pieces are one of a kind I usually can't send a replacement.
    </p>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      Email <Email />, or find me on
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/matkaceramics/" rel="me">Instagram</a>,
      where new work is announced first.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
